{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S01、S05这类短停留段落里感受词堆叠偏密，扫读速度不如Y轻松。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左右分栏更容易快速扫读，感受词也比较精简，但不少音乐细节和心理变化被压缩成了概括性的词。X的重点加亮让人能迅速抓住人物心理，感受又能随音乐段落逐步出现，尤其把从害怕暴露心意、享受亲近、担心失去，到最终不再隐藏喜欢的连续变化呈现得更完整，音乐与心理也结合得更细。虽然X有局部拥挤的问题，但作为整首曲子的观众体验，我认为它更有层次，也更能让人理解这个人为什么这样想、这样做。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "950d716d-5448-411c-95e1-efa76a8a0b1d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T231439444704Z", "elapsed_seconds": 50.094, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:15:29.541231+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "47d0b9a3e4ab41710356f35966bde7883d87e973a3029fbabe74f1d8d6b49f52", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachm